      "parseSceneNode passes groups through if available in params"
    ],
    "edge_cases": [
      "TCP protocol may not include groups in scene_tree_parse_end — check actual param layout"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "game-bridge-log-clear",
    "subject": "No way to clear the game log/error buffers — stale logs persist across reloads",
    "status": "pending",
    "description": "gd-repl-bridge.js _log_buffer and _err_buffer grow up to 500 entries and dedupe in CLI. But after game reload, old logs persist in buffer. No DELETE /logs endpoint to clear them. Agents reading logs after a reload see pre-reload output mixed with new output.",
    "blocking": [],
    "blockedBy": [],
    "effort": "small",
    "category": "feature",
    "acceptance": [
      "DELETE /logs clears _log_buffer",
      "DELETE /errors clears _err_buffer",
      "cli-game.js gets 'logs-clear' command calling DELETE /logs"
    ],
    "edge_cases": [
      "clear should also reset the seenLogs Set in dashboard on next refresh"
    ]
  },
